1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,560
Our Sales Department has a particularly proud record since the founding of the company in 1946.

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:16,120
Starting out just after the Second World War, our company employed three traveling salesmen and a national sales manager to expand our operations aggressively throughout North America.

3
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:20,270
Of course, we couldn't have done that without top quality products to sell.

4
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:29,820
On the other hand, without sales and a hungry sales staff, the company would not have been able to survive, let alone expand as it has done in the last sixty years.

5
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:41,435
You have been chosen from a field of sixty applicants to continue that tradition, and we have faith that through your energy and positive attitude we will be able to continue our expansion to markets all over the world.
